    "intro_narrative": "You are a clockwork engineer trapped inside the abandoned subterranean workshop of the legendary inventor Archimedes Vance. Surrounding you are towering brass machines, hissing steam pipes, and the relentless ticking of thousands of interlocking gears. The massive steel door behind you has sealed shut, and the facility's pressure gauges are dropping rapidly. If the pressure fails completely, the entire workshop will collapse into the toxic aether below. Your only hope is to restart the facility's main power source: the master chrono-engine. To achieve this, you must analyze ancient punch cards, restore power to localized machines, and synchronize the pressure systems across the workshop. Follow the intricate web of mechanical dependencies and operate the arcane devices in the correct sequence. There is no time to waste—the gears of your destiny are already turning.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
  },
